        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ug-row">
        <div>
          <h3>House rules</h3>
          <p>
            These are the decisions that keep the kit coherent as pages get added. Most of them are
            the inverse of a mistake the pre-kit pages made.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ul class="ug-rules">
            <li>
              <span class="ug-mark is-dont">DON'T</span>
              <span>Use <code>heading-style-*</code>, <code>text-size-*</code>, <code>button-2</code> or <code>padding-section-*</code> off the homepage. <b>They are tuned for one layout and break everywhere else</b> — <code>heading-style-h6</code> is 0.875rem/600, a label rather than a heading.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="ug-mark is-do">DO</span>
              <span>Reach for <code>.mk-h4</code> for card titles. <b>Light weights only work at display sizes;</b> below 24px they read as unfinished.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="ug-mark is-do">DO</span>
              <span>Let the band decide the card treatment. <b>Border on white, shadow on sand</b> — the kit already handles this, so don't add both.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="ug-mark is-dont">DON'T</span>
              <span>Add a font-size media query. <b>Every size in the kit is a <code>clamp()</code></b>; if something is wrong at a width, fix the clamp.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="ug-mark is-do">DO</span>
              <span>Keep <code>.mk-callout</code> to one per page and <code>--ink</code> surfaces to the CTA. <b>Emphasis stops working when everything has it.</b></span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="ug-mark is-do">DO</span>
              <span>Re-run <code>npm run test:visual:update</code> after an intentional redesign, but <b>check the untouched pages didn't move first.</b></span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer variant="legal" />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
